__pycache__/
*.pyc

# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This tree lives in iCloud, and writing ~2,000
# small index shards makes it duplicate files asynchronously as it syncs
# ("aa 2.json"), after the build has already finished — so build.sh cannot
# reliably sweep them itself. They are never referenced: data/index/manifest.json
# lists the real names. To clear them out by hand:
#   find data/index -name "* [0-9].json" -delete
* [0-9].*
